    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Lens-Tuned Recall.</strong> Your memory has grooves worn into it by repeated passes over the same strange patterns.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Occult (Mind)</strong> and <strong>Lore (Mind)</strong> checks made to recall information about <strong>Sparks, Tikkun workings, Qliphothic phenomena,</strong> or <strong>Sephirotic anomalies</strong>.</li><li>If you fail such a check by 5 or less, the GM may give you a partial or sideways answer instead of nothing.</li></ul>",
